 "name": "Immobilized Limbs",
 "type": "feat",
 "img": "modules/jjk5e/icons/techniques/paralyzing-gaze.svg",
 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: Must have Immobilizing Eyes</em></p>\n<p>When you use Immobilizing Eyes, you can spend 1 additional CE as part of activating the technique concentrate your eyes on a specific part of the creature, also causing one of the following restrictions while you maintain your technique:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Legs</strong>. The target’s speed is halved. If the target tries to move more than their movement speed, they must make a Dexterity saving throw or fall prone.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Arms</strong>. The target gains an additional -3 penalty to attack rolls and cannot take object interactions.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Torso</strong>. You reduce the target’s AC by 3.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
   "chat": ""
  },
